# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights & checkpoints
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.bin
*.h5
*.pb
*.tflite
checkpoints/
weights/
foundation_weights/
# ...but `quantem_em.weights` is a source package, not a bag of checkpoints: it is
# the registry and fetcher that decide *where* weights come from. The rule above
# matches the directory, and git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the directory itself has to be un-ignored here.
!quantem-core/src/quantem_em/weights/

