.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.shared.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset directory (dataset_directory/)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Thumbnails are built, not committed: every regeneration would add hundreds of
# megabytes of permanent blobs to the repository. They ship as a release asset
# and CI unpacks them into the published site.
dataset_directory/thumbs/
dataset_directory/thumbs-*.tar.gz
dataset_directory/thumbs-*.tar.gz.sha256
dataset_directory/exporter/raw/
# The built site is assembled by CI; nothing under dist/ is authored.
dataset_directory/dist/

# dataset_directory/data/ IS committed on purpose — it is small, text, and the
# reviewable record of exactly what the site publishes. Re-allow it against the
# unanchored patterns above.
!dataset_directory/data/
!dataset_directory/data/*.json
!dataset_directory/data/*.csv
!dataset_directory/data/*.md
dataset_directory/.serve.log
